---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy · SpaCar Academy" description="Privacy Policy of SPACAR Auto Sales LLC (SpaCar Academy)." lang="en">
  <main>
    <section class="text-light relative jarallax">
      <img src="/images/full-detail.webp" class="jarallax-img" alt="" />
      <div class="hero-overlay-15"></div>
      <div class="container relative z-2">
        <div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="spacer-single"></div>
            <div class="subtitle id-color mb-2 wow fadeInUp">Legal</div>
            <h1 class="mb-0 wow fadeInUp">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="vsl-kicker mt-2">Last updated: August 4, 2026</p>
            <div class="spacer-single"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gradient-edge-bottom"></div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
          <div class="col-lg-8 legal-body">

            <h3>1. Who we are</h3>
            <p>This Privacy Policy explains how SPACAR Auto Sales LLC, doing business as SpaCar Academy ("we," "us," or "our"), collects, uses, shares, and protects information from individuals who visit our website, complete our forms, or communicate with us by phone, SMS, or WhatsApp.</p>
            <div class="legal-contact-box">
              <strong>SPACAR Auto Sales LLC (SpaCar Academy)</strong><br />
              7425 Catania Loop, Clermont, FL 34714, United States<br />
              Email: <a href="mailto:giobanyescalona@gmail.com">giobanyescalona@gmail.com</a><br />
              Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+13525572136">+1 (352) 557-2136</a><br />
              SMS and calls: <a href="tel:+18556266047">+1 (855) 626-6047</a>
            </div>

            <h3>2. Information we collect</h3>
            <p>When you complete our booking form or any other form on this site, we may collect:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>First and last name.</li>
              <li>Phone number.</li>
              <li>Email address (if requested).</li>
              <li>Information about your detailing business that you choose to share (for example, approximate revenue or current situation).</li>
              <li>Any additional information you choose to include in the form.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>3. How we use your information</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>To confirm and manage your booking or strategy call.</li>
              <li>To contact you by phone, SMS, or WhatsApp to coordinate date, time, and logistical details.</li>
              <li>To send reminders related to your call or program.</li>
              <li>To send promotions or news from SpaCar Academy, only if you gave consent for that.</li>
              <li>To improve our services and website experience.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>4. Text messaging (SMS) and calls program</h3>
            <p>By entering your phone number and checking the consent box on our form, you authorize SpaCar Academy to send you text messages (SMS) and/or make calls, including automated messages, related to your booking and, if you accepted, for promotional purposes.</p>
            <p><strong>Message frequency:</strong> Message frequency may vary.</p>
            <p><strong>Costs:</strong> Message and data rates may apply.</p>
            <p><strong>Cancel / Help:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to cancel message delivery at any time, or <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. You can also call us directly at <a href="tel:+18556266047">+1 (855) 626-6047</a>, or email us at <a href="mailto:giobanyescalona@gmail.com">giobanyescalona@gmail.com</a>.</p>
            <p><strong>No sale or exchange of messaging data:</strong> Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent information, as well as phone numbers, will not be shared with, sold to, rented to, or transferred to any third party or affiliate for marketing or promotional purposes. This information is used solely to provide you with the messaging service described in this policy.</p>
            <p><strong>Service providers:</strong> We use third-party messaging platforms (such as Twilio) and our form/CRM system only as technical providers to send and receive your messages, not as recipients of your data for their own purposes.</p>

            <h3>5. Cookies, tracking technologies, and analytics</h3>
            <p>This site uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to function properly and to understand how visitors use the site.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> necessary for the site to work properly (for example, maintaining the state of a popup form).</li>
              <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> help us understand which pages you visit, how long you stay, and how you arrived at the site, so we can improve content and navigation.</li>
              <li><strong>Pixels and tracking technologies:</strong> we may use tracking pixels (for example, from Meta/Facebook or Google) to measure the effectiveness of our advertising campaigns and show you relevant ads on other platforms.</li>
              <li><strong>Third-party tools:</strong> our booking form and messaging system (including the SMS/voice messaging provider and form management platform) may use their own cookies or technical identifiers to process your request.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings. Please note that disabling certain cookies may affect the operation of the booking form or other site features. The cookies and tracking technologies described here do not collect or share your SMS opt-in data, which is governed exclusively by Section 4 of this policy.</p>

            <h3>6. How we share your information</h3>
            <p>We do not sell your personal information. We only share it with:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Service providers that help us operate the site, manage bookings, and send communications (for example, SMS/voice messaging platforms and form management platforms), under confidentiality obligations.</li>
              <li>Analytics and advertising tools that help us understand site traffic, as described in Section 5 above.</li>
              <li>Competent authorities, when required by law.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>7. Your rights</h3>
            <p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of your information at any time. You may opt out of promotional text messages or calls by replying STOP or contacting us directly. You may also request that we stop processing your information for marketing purposes without affecting your already confirmed booking. To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="tel:+18556266047">+1 (855) 626-6047</a> or by email at <a href="mailto:giobanyescalona@gmail.com">giobanyescalona@gmail.com</a>.</p>

            <h3>8. Data security</h3>
            <p>We apply reasonable measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. However, no system is 100% secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

            <h3>9. Minors</h3>
            <p>Our services are directed to individuals 18 years of age or older. We do not knowingly collect information from minors through our forms.</p>

            <h3>10. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h3>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the current version.</p>

            <h3>11. Contact</h3>
            <table class="legal-table">
              <tbody>
                <tr><th>Company</th><td>SPACAR Auto Sales LLC (SpaCar Academy)</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Email</th><td><a href="mailto:giobanyescalona@gmail.com">giobanyescalona@gmail.com</a></td></tr>
                <tr><th>Address</th><td>7425 Catania Loop, Clermont, FL 34714</td></tr>
                <tr><th>WhatsApp</th><td><a href="tel:+13525572136">+1 (352) 557-2136</a></td></tr>
                <tr><th>SMS and Calls</th><td><a href="tel:+18556266047">+1 (855) 626-6047</a></td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>

            <div class="divider my-4" style="height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);"></div>
            <p class="vsl-disclaimer">
              SPACAR Auto Sales LLC (SpaCar Academy) · giobanyescalona@gmail.com · 7425 Catania Loop, Clermont, FL 34714<br />
              WhatsApp: +1 (352) 557-2136 · SMS/Calls: +1 (855) 626-6047
            </p>
            <p><a href="/index.html" class="id-color fw-bold">Home</a> · <a href="/terms-and-conditions" class="id-color fw-bold">Terms and Conditions</a></p>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
